        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:7",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And when he had reigned for the space of forty and two years the people did rise up in rebellion against him; and there began to be war again in the land, insomuch that Riplakish was killed, and his descendants were driven out of the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:8",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass after the space of many years, Morianton, (he being a descendant of Riplakish) gathered together an army of outcasts, and went forth and gave battle unto the people; and he gained power over many cities; and the war became exceedingly sore, and did last for the space of many years; and he did gain power over all the land, and did establish himself king over all the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:9",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And after that he had established himself king he did ease the burden of the people, by which he did gain favor in the eyes of the people, and they did anoint him to be their king.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:10",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And he did do justice unto the people, but not unto himself because of his many whoredoms; wherefore he was cut off from the presence of the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 89,
            "text": "TG Whore."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Whore.",
            "prettyString": "TG Whore",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Whore",
                "entryId": "tg-whore",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:11",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Morianton built up many cities, and the people became exceedingly rich under his reign, both in buildings, and in gold and silver, and in raising grain, and in flocks, and herds, and such things which had been restored unto them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 139,
            "end": 143,
            "text": "Ether 9:17 (17–18)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:12",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And Morianton did live to an exceedingly great age, and then he begat Kim; and Kim did reign in the stead of his father; and he did reign eight years, and his father died. And it came to pass that Kim did not reign in righteousness, wherefore he was not favored of the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 205,
            "end": 208,
            "text": "1 Ne. 17:35 (34–35)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:13",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And his brother did rise up in rebellion against him, by which he did bring him into captivity; and he did remain in captivity all his days; and he begat sons and daughters in captivity, and in his old age he begat Levi; and he died.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 94,
            "text": "Ether 7:7; 8:4 (3–4); 10:30 (30–31)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:14",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Levi did serve in captivity after the death of his father, for the space of forty and two years. And he did make war against the king of the land, by which he did obtain unto himself the kingdom.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 10:15",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And after he had obtained unto himself the kingdom he did that which was right in the sight of the Lord; and the people did prosper in the land; and he did live to a good old age, and begat sons and daughters; and he also begat Corom, whom he anointed king in his stead.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 171,
            "end": 174,
            "text": "TG Old Age."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Old Age.",
            "prettyString": "TG Old Age",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Old Age",
                "entryId": "tg-old-age",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
